       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I'd like you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg is 5 times the maximum recommended daily dose.** The usual adult dose is 2.5 to 10 mg by mouth once daily, and 10 mg is the maximum. Amlodipine overdose can cause severe low blood pressure that's hard to treat. Because the drug stays in the body for a long time (half-life of about 30 to 50 hours), the effects can last for days.\n\nThis looks like it could be a typo for **5 mg**, which is a common starting dose.\n\nPlease let me know which you'd like:\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg PO once daily** (or another dose between 2.5 and 10 mg)\n2. **Amlodipine 50 mg PO once daily as written.** If you really mean this dose, please confirm and tell me the clinical reason so I can document it in the order note."
